#: kio_floppy.cpp:209
msgid ""
"drive %1.\n"
"The drive is still busy.\n"
"Wait until it has stopped working and then try again."
msgstr ""
"dryf %1.\n"
"Die dryf is nogsteeds besig.\n"
"Wag totdat dit het op gehou werksaam en dan word probeer weer."

#: kio_floppy.cpp:213 kio_floppy.cpp:1124
msgid ""
"\n"
"The disk in drive %1 is probably full."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Die disket in dryf %1 is waarskynlik volgrote."

#: kio_floppy.cpp:223
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"There is probably no disk in the drive %1"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Daar is waarskynlik nee disket in die dryf %1"

#: kio_floppy.cpp:227
msgid ""
"\n"
"The drive %1 is not supported."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Die dryf %1 is nie ondersteunde."

#: kio_floppy.cpp:232
msgid ""
"\n"
"Make sure the floppy in drive %1 is a DOS formatted floppy disk \n"
"and that the permissions of the device file (e.g. /dev/fd0) are set "
"correctly (e.g. rwxrwxrwx)."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Maak seker die sagteskyf in dryf %1 is 'n Dos geformateerde sagteskyf disket "
"\n"
"en wat die regte van die toestel lêer (e.g. /dev/fd0) word stel korrek "
"(e.g. rwxrwxrwx)."

#: kio_floppy.cpp:236
msgid ""
"\n"
"The disk in drive %1 is probably not a DOS formatted floppy disk."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Die disket in dryf %1 is waarskynlik nie 'n Dos geformateerde sagteskyf "
"disket."

#: kio_floppy.cpp:240
msgid ""
"\n"
"The disk in drive %1 is probably write-protected."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Die disket in dryf %1 is waarskynlik write-protected."

#: kio_floppy.cpp:284 kio_floppy.cpp:511 kio_floppy.cpp:602 kio_floppy.cpp:735
#: kio_floppy.cpp:812 kio_floppy.cpp:898 kio_floppy.cpp:978
#: kio_floppy.cpp:1078
msgid ""
"\n"
"Ensure that the mtools package is installed correctly on your system."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Maak seker wat die mtools paket is geïnstalleer korrek op jou stelsel."

#: kio_floppy.cpp:558 kio_floppy.cpp:573 kio_floppy.cpp:577 kio_floppy.cpp:647
msgid "Reason unknown."
msgstr "Rede onbekende."
